@startuml sd_us102
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
title US102 - Sequence Diagram
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
actor "ATCC" as Actor
participant "Entry (Envoy)\nvirtual IP of aircraft-maintenance" as EAM
box "aircraft-maintenance-n (the replica that answers)" #F7F7F7
participant "AircraftController" as AircraftController
participant "RegisterAircraftUseCase" as RegisterAircraftUseCase
database "own database" as DBAM
participant "Outbox dispatcher" as OBAM
end box
collections "peer replicas\naircraft-maintenance-m" as PAM
== POST /api/aircrafts ==
Actor -> EAM : POST /api/aircrafts\n(HTTPS, Authorization: Bearer JWT)
EAM -> AircraftController : to a ready replica\n(another one if it fails)
AircraftController -> RegisterAircraftUseCase : execute(...)
RegisterAircraftUseCase -> DBAM : registration number already here?
opt not found here
RegisterAircraftUseCase -> PAM : GET /internal/aircrafts/{registration}\n(asks the peers)
PAM --> RegisterAircraftUseCase : 200 / 404
end
RegisterAircraftUseCase -> DBAM : aircraft models (catalog, complete here)
RegisterAircraftUseCase -> DBAM : save aircraft + copy for the next replica in the outbox\n(same transaction)
RegisterAircraftUseCase --> AircraftController : created
AircraftController --> Actor : 201 Created
OBAM -> PAM : PUT /internal/replicas/aircrafts\n(to the next replica in the ring, retried until delivered)
PAM --> OBAM : 200 (applied if newer)
@enduml
